=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Tapoh Lihzeh}. Just a little bit North East of HP #1.
** Will not start quest if {q:Chocobilious|Chocobilious|Chocobilious} is active.
* Trade her either 3 {i:Beehive Chips|Beehive Chip|912} or 2 {i:Remi Shells|Remi Shell|1016} to complete the quest.
** {i:Beehive Chips|Beehive Chip|912} can be purchased for 40 gil from {n:Odoba} at the Bastok Mines Alchemy Guild - (K-6). HP #3 is the closest warp.
** Both can be easily farmed from {z:West Sarutabaruta}, from {m:Bees|Bee} and {m:River Crabs|River Crab} respectively.
* Your reward depends on which items you gave her to complete the quest.
** Trading {i:Beehive Chips|Beehive Chip|912} reward you with 150 gil.
** Trading {i:Remi Shells|Remi Shell|1016} will reward you with 200 gil.

=2 Notes
If you are doing this quest for a {p:Vana'Bout} objective and have already completed the quest at least once, you do not need to speak to {n:Tapoh Lihzeh} again to start the quest. You can collect the {i:Beehive Chips|Beehive Chip|912} or {i:Remi Shells|Remi Shell|1016} and then trade it to {n:Tapoh Lihzeh}.
